      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't think this is a common enough occurence for this to even be worth the effort of being implemented. Plus there's the chance that all of someone's potentially amazing avatars won't ever be seen if by chance you see their shitpost meme avatar first and decide to hit that button.",
      "viewerReactions": null
